  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive). Pattern: X⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{訪|たず}ねる (visit X).\n\nASPECT: て⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ indicates ongoing or completed action. {訪|たず}ねて⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ = 'is visiting.'\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{人|ひと}→人：00476_hito⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{訪|たず}ねる (visit a person)\n- ⟦{場所|ばしょ}→場所：00829_basho⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{訪|たず}ねる (visit a place)\n- {訪|たず}ねて⟦{来|く}る→来る：00254_kuru⟧ (come to visit)\n- {訪|たず}ねて⟦{行|い}く→行く：00119_iku⟧ (go to visit)\n\nHOMOPHONE: Don't confuse with ⟦{尋|たず}ねる→尋ねる：01175_tazuneru⟧ (to ask/inquire), which has the same reading but different kanji and meaning.\n- {訪|たず}ねる ({訪|たず}): to visit\n- ⟦{尋|たず}ねる→尋ねる：01175_tazuneru⟧ ({尋|たず}): to ask, inquire\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{訪問|ほうもん}する→訪問する：03622_houmon⟧: to visit (more formal)\n- ⟦{伺|うかが}う→伺う：01273_ukagau⟧: to visit (humble)\n\nREGISTER: Neutral to slightly formal.",
